      "location": "Middle region of the plot, around x=2007 to x=2011.",
      "fact": "The line descends steadily through markers labeled $21.4°C, $20.0°C, $17.9°C, $15.5°C, and $15.3°C; the 2010 and 2011 markers are close in height."
    },
    {
      "location": "Lower-right region of the plot, around x=2012 to x=2014.",
      "fact": "The line continues downward to the lowest vertical positions, with markers labeled $13.8°C, $11.3°C, and $10.1°C; the 2014 marker is the lowest point on the chart."
    },
    {
      "location": "Vertical extent of the data line.",
      "fact": "The vertical drop from the 2005 marker to the 2014 marker covers roughly the distance between the y-axis gridline at 20 and the gridline at 10, indicating a substantial change across the period."
